## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-Dataflow DoFn masking PII
class MaskPiIFn extends DoFn {
  processElement(ctx) {
    const record = ctx.element;
    record.email = mask(record.email);
    record.phone = mask(record.phone);
    return record;
  }
}
```

